    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's so heavy... the weight is almost all I can feel. And when you say \"let the edge guide you\"... it's like you're saying it's okay to stop fighting it. To just stop. Is that what it means? To finally just let go of the struggle and find that lightness you're talking about?",
